{"id":1419,"date":"2025-07-31T18:58:00","date_gmt":"2025-07-31T18:58:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/cutestoryevents.com\/?p=1419"},"modified":"2026-08-05T02:14:55","modified_gmt":"2026-08-04T20:14:55","slug":"sculpt-bodywork-self-care-community-event","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/cutestoryevents.com\/sculpt-bodywork-self-care-community-event\/","title":{"rendered":"Event Recap: A Delightful Celebration of Self-Care!"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p id=\"viewer-k6oyy157\">What an incredible event we had at <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https:\/\/www.sculptbodywork.com\/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><u>Sculpt Bodywork<\/u><\/a>! The energy was palpable as we came together to celebrate the importance of self-care. From the moment you walked through the doors, you could feel the excitement in the air.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1208\" height=\"1216\" src=\"https:\/\/cutestoryevents.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/self-care-wellness-vendor-event-sculpt-bodywork.avif\" alt=\"Guests visiting wellness and self-care vendor booths during a community event hosted by Sculpt Bodywork.\" class=\"wp-image-1421\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p id=\"viewer-t1yiq482\">The highlight of the day was the $1,000 worth of self-care items and services that were given away as door prizes. The vendors were passionate and knowledgeable, sharing their expertise on everything from pain management and nutrition to hypnosis, hydrotherapy, massage, chiropractic care, and beyond.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1223\" height=\"906\" src=\"https:\/\/cutestoryevents.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/wellness-products-self-care-giveaway-table.avif\" alt=\"Table display featuring wellness products, essential oils, massage items, and self-care giveaway prizes at the Sculpt Bodywork event.\" class=\"wp-image-1422\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p id=\"viewer-wujq5547\">It was truly inspiring to hear the vendors speak about the different ways we can take care of our bodies and minds. The message was clear &#8211; self-care is not a luxury, but a necessity for our overall well-being.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1214\" height=\"1573\" src=\"https:\/\/cutestoryevents.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/self-care-community-speaker-sculpt-bodywork.avif\" alt=\"Speaker addressing attendees during a self-care and wellness community event hosted by Sculpt Bodywork.\" class=\"wp-image-1420\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p id=\"viewer-z6kuq591\">&#8216;The charcuterie boards from <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wildsaltstudio.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><u>WildSalt Studio<\/u><\/a>&nbsp;were the perfect accompaniment to this celebration of self-care. Beautifully crafted and bursting with flavor, they were a delightful treat for the senses. Other vendors that were eager to participate, including <a href=\"https:\/\/nuhealthclinic.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><u>NuHealth<\/u><\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.intunenutrition.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><u>In Tune Nutrition<\/u><\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/luckylocks_vancouver\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><u>Lucky Locks<\/u><\/a>, <a href=\"https:\/\/shifthypnosis.org\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><u>Shift Happens<\/u><\/a>&nbsp;and of course, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.sculptbodywork.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><u>Sculpt Bodywork<\/u><\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1230\" height=\"906\" src=\"https:\/\/cutestoryevents.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/wildsalt-studio-charcuterie-board-wellness-event.avif\" alt=\"Charcuterie board by WildSalt Studio featuring cheeses, fruit, cured meats, and snacks served during a self-care community event.\" class=\"wp-image-1423\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p id=\"viewer-v6eim649\">This event was a testament to the power of community and the importance of prioritizing our own health and happiness. We left feeling rejuvenated, inspired, and ready to incorporate more self-care into our daily lives. Thank you, Sculpt Bodywork for creating such a wonderful and memorable experience.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-a89b3969 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/cutestoryevents.com\/connect\/\">Click here to plan your next event with Cute Story!<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>This self-care community event at Sculpt Bodywork brought together wellness experts, thoughtful vendors, giveaways, charcuterie, and meaningful conversations focused on health, healing, and well-being.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":1421,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_uag_custom_page_level_css":"","site-sidebar-layout":"default","site-content-layout":"","ast-site-content-layout":"default","site-content-style":"default","site-sidebar-style":"default","ast-global-header-display":"","ast-banner-title-visibility":"","ast-main-header-display":"","ast-hfb-above-header-display":"","ast-hfb-below-header-display":"","ast-hfb-mobile-header-display":"","site-post-title":"","ast-breadcrumbs-content":"","ast-featured-img":"","footer-sml-layout":"","ast-disable-related-posts":"","theme-transparent-header-meta":"","adv-header-id-meta":"","stick-header-meta":"","header-above-stick-meta":"","header-main-stick-meta":"","header-below-stick-meta":"","astra-migrate-meta-layouts":"default","ast-page-background-enabled":"default","as